  "title": "REPAY Announces New Consumer Payments Leader",
  "summary": "ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Apr. 16, 2026-- Repay Holdings Corporation (NASDAQ: RPAY) (“REPAY” or the “Company”), a leading provider of integrated payment processing solutions, today announced the appointment of Matt Morrow as the new executive leader of Consumer Payments, effective May 12, 2026. Matt will lead REPAY’s Consumer Payments overall strategy, overseeing the segment’s growth, sales, and operational initiatives across REPAY’s consumer finance […]",
